Apple has raised the MacBook Neo's starting price from &#36;599 to &#36;649 on its <a href="https://www.apple.com/us-edu/shop/buy-mac/macbook-neo">online education store</a> in the U.S., meaning it now offers college students and other eligible groups only a &#36;50 discount on the laptop, down from &#36;100. The change was made within the past week, with equivalent increases in local currencies in other countries.<br/>
